Date: Mon, 2 Mar 2026 00:46:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 198/244] Fix order placement errors by adjusting currency and
 order logic

Corrected currency defaults to AUD and removed stop/limit fields when forceOpen is false in the CEO proxy. Updated frontend scripts in model-config.html, processes.html, and workers.html.

Replit-Commit-Author: Agent
Replit-Commit-Session-Id: 906b397c-0d51-4c51-938d-028fd77f33b5
